Rancho Platform

Independent community extension for Rancher 1.6 Docker/Cattle.
This project is not an official Rancher release or an endorsement by its maintainers.

Backend patches target the Apache-2.0-licensed rancher/cattle source at the
commit recorded in upstream.json. The host stream proxy patch targets the
Apache-2.0-licensed rancher/websocket-proxy source pinned in the same file.
Original upstream notices and vendored dependency licenses remain in those sources.
The legacy UI extension derives from rancher/ui, whose license is preserved
in legacy-ui/LICENSE. Rancher names, symbols and wordmarks identify the
upstream product; their inclusion does not transfer trademark rights.

The console bundles Inter under the SIL Open Font License, available at
console/public/licenses/Inter-OFL.txt. Dependency licenses remain applicable;
the release dependency/license review is a separate REL04 gate. Inventory tooling
is documented in docs/en/release.md; generated metadata is
not an automatic license approval.
